WEBVTT

01:30.566 --> 01:31.551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

01:31.551 --> 01:33.560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

01:35.660 --> 01:38.260
=Episode 18=

01:42.120 --> 01:43.070
So that's what it was all about.

01:45.760 --> 01:46.870
He heard the word "Chun"

01:47.350 --> 01:48.350
and forgot everything else.

01:52.510 --> 01:53.400
To be honest,

01:53.680 --> 01:54.310
I used to

01:54.920 --> 01:56.280
look down on your friend.

01:57.560 --> 01:58.400
A man like him

01:58.790 --> 02:00.230
only cares about fame and power,

02:00.840 --> 02:02.680
weighing every move.

02:03.680 --> 02:04.790
He's nothing like us.

02:06.760 --> 02:07.590
Beneath that rough exterior,

02:07.840 --> 02:09.030
there's actually a good heart.

02:12.080 --> 02:13.430
I've known Wenji for a long time.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.960
He's a man of true feeling.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.240
But born into an official's family,

02:17.430 --> 02:18.150
raised in luxury and power,

02:18.630 --> 02:20.520
he carries burdens he can't escape.

02:21.030 --> 02:22.120
They're all sons of officials,

02:22.630 --> 02:24.080
yet Wenji still hesitates,

02:24.960 --> 02:25.710
while others

02:27.190 --> 02:28.470
have lost their minds.

02:30.080 --> 02:31.870
Not all officials are alike.

02:32.960 --> 02:34.750
If Liu Wenji's father came to Sheng'an,

02:35.470 --> 02:36.750
even with gold in hand,

02:36.800 --> 02:38.400
he couldn't get past Zhang Jun's gate.

02:43.470 --> 02:44.840
You want to help him get justice?

02:47.430 --> 02:48.280
Is it that obvious?

02:49.560 --> 02:51.470
You were talking about Liu Wenji,

02:52.150 --> 02:53.520
but you were already plotting

02:53.840 --> 02:55.470
how to make Zhang Jun beg for death.

02:58.190 --> 02:59.840
Your Highness,
that's a frightening thought.

03:01.870 --> 03:03.360
If you don't need my help,

03:04.310 --> 03:05.680
I'll just sit back and do nothing.

03:07.280 --> 03:07.680
Your Highness,

03:08.310 --> 03:09.030
of course I need your help.

03:15.190 --> 03:15.520
Your Highness.

03:17.150 --> 03:18.080
Do something for me.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.240
Just say the word.

03:26.000 --> 03:26.280
Understood.

03:30.080 --> 03:31.190
Having tea, Cuihua?

03:33.840 --> 03:34.680
Not bad-looking.

03:35.280 --> 03:36.210
- Mind your words, sir.
- I'll come see you later!

03:36.260 --> 03:36.980
(Dear, look.)

03:44.120 --> 03:44.630
Bring out the food!

03:56.660 --> 03:57.250
(Cuiyun Tower)

03:57.300 --> 04:00.890
Sir, pick me again next time!

04:00.940 --> 04:02.310
All right. I'll pick you.

04:02.400 --> 04:03.080
Watch this trick.

04:03.240 --> 04:04.030
Leaping onto the horse!

04:04.280 --> 04:04.590
Okay.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.430
So brave!

04:24.480 --> 04:25.360
Don't go...

05:08.040 --> 05:08.430
Aren't you cold?

05:12.070 --> 05:12.800
Let's talk inside.

05:14.480 --> 05:14.920
No.

05:16.310 --> 05:18.390
Out here, I can see the moon.

05:19.070 --> 05:21.270
Inside, it's stuffy and dark.

05:22.430 --> 05:23.950
Some people earn
a capital official's salary

05:24.240 --> 05:25.830
but won't even buy a few extra candles.

05:27.270 --> 05:28.190
Next time you come,

05:28.360 --> 05:29.160
let me know in advance,

05:29.480 --> 05:30.360
and I'll light a few more.

05:31.750 --> 05:34.070
Save your salary for yourself.

05:35.600 --> 05:37.430
I should come here less often.

05:38.270 --> 05:39.160
Every visit

05:39.870 --> 05:41.240
brings nothing but trouble and worry.

05:45.600 --> 05:46.390
Is it about Zhang Jun?

05:48.070 --> 05:49.190
Fang Tong followed him for days

05:49.870 --> 05:51.160
and dug up some information.

05:52.360 --> 05:54.830
Every day,
the brat leaves the Minister's Estate

05:55.270 --> 05:56.680
and heads straight for brothels.

05:57.430 --> 05:59.310
After blowing cash and eating his fill,

06:00.040 --> 06:01.270
he struts through the streets

06:01.800 --> 06:03.070
and heads out of town to hunt.

06:03.390 --> 06:04.310
Same routine, day after day.

06:06.240 --> 06:07.830
Isn't that how rich brats live?

06:09.240 --> 06:10.120
Since he loves hunting,

06:11.040 --> 06:11.830
is he any good at it?

06:29.480 --> 06:30.800
(Firing three arrows at once?)

06:37.830 --> 06:38.240
Nice shot!

06:38.290 --> 06:39.530
Zhang Cheng, the Minister of Revenue,

06:39.920 --> 06:41.360
was nearly sixty when this son was born.

06:41.410 --> 06:42.450
Let's take a look ahead!

06:42.510 --> 06:44.070
He's useless at both books and weapons,

06:44.360 --> 06:45.360
a complete fool,

06:46.160 --> 06:48.310
yet he's shielded
by his father and grandfather.

06:49.390 --> 06:51.270
His father frequents
Lord Yu's residence,

06:51.680 --> 06:52.630
kissing up and currying favor,

06:53.040 --> 06:54.240
and Yu Cheng'an thinks highly of him.

06:55.190 --> 06:55.920
This family

06:56.430 --> 06:57.040
can't be brought down

06:57.090 --> 06:58.900
by some low-ranking official

06:58.950 --> 06:59.750
like you.

07:00.720 --> 07:01.480
Even I,

07:02.040 --> 07:03.270
a princess in name only,

07:03.680 --> 07:04.600
can't lay a finger on him.

07:06.000 --> 07:07.240
Do I need to do it myself?

07:08.310 --> 07:09.920
Sheng'an is like an arena.

07:10.600 --> 07:11.390
Fierce tigers

07:11.920 --> 07:13.920
will devour jackals like Zhang Jun.

07:21.560 --> 07:23.920
Since he dares to hurt others
in broad daylight,

07:24.720 --> 07:26.040
we should return the "favor,"

07:26.480 --> 07:27.430
an eye for an eye.

07:28.310 --> 07:30.040
We should let him die in broad daylight,

07:31.160 --> 07:32.600
knowing full well why.

07:35.190 --> 07:36.750
Only one family can be the tiger

07:37.600 --> 07:38.560
to take down the Zhangs

07:39.190 --> 07:40.190
in all of Sheng'an.

07:48.120 --> 07:48.890
What are you doing?

07:48.940 --> 07:49.740
Know your place?

07:49.870 --> 07:51.270
You dare knock on Lord Yu's back gate?

07:52.040 --> 07:52.800
I'm Yan Shang.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.360
Mr. Yu Xianyao did me a favor,

07:54.750 --> 07:55.830
so I'm here to thank him in person.

07:56.360 --> 07:57.800
Please announce my arrival.

07:58.390 --> 07:59.480
You're here to see him?

07:59.750 --> 08:00.070
Yes.

08:00.600 --> 08:01.160
Come with me, then.

08:02.630 --> 08:02.920
All right.

08:03.040 --> 08:04.510
Wait, they just let him in?

08:05.070 --> 08:06.210
- How'd he get in?
- We've been waiting ages!

08:06.260 --> 08:06.930
Why does he get to go in?

08:06.980 --> 08:08.150
Why can't we?

08:37.960 --> 08:38.320
My savior?

08:40.480 --> 08:40.840
My savior?

08:49.320 --> 08:50.390
It's you.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.440
What brings you here?

08:54.390 --> 08:55.600
Last time at Cuiyun Tower,

08:56.000 --> 08:57.120
I didn't have enough money

08:57.240 --> 08:57.870
to give you a proper welcome.

08:58.440 --> 08:59.440
I've felt bad about it ever since.

09:00.390 --> 09:02.200
I've just been appointed
and received my first salary.

09:02.840 --> 09:05.120
Would you honor me with another chance?

09:05.600 --> 09:06.270
We'll eat to our hearts' content.

09:07.360 --> 09:07.960
No!

09:08.510 --> 09:08.960
I'm tired of the food there.

09:10.720 --> 09:11.120
Well, then...

09:13.440 --> 09:14.150
Greetings, Lord Yu.

09:14.630 --> 09:15.000
Father!

09:19.790 --> 09:20.550
Yan Shang.

09:23.390 --> 09:24.960
How do you two know each other?

09:26.000 --> 09:26.670
I met him

09:27.080 --> 09:28.200
at Chancellor Liu's residence.

09:29.030 --> 09:29.360
Yes.

09:30.360 --> 09:31.480
I happened to meet Mr. Yu Xianyao

09:31.670 --> 09:32.910
at Chancellor Liu's residence.

09:33.480 --> 09:34.270
By a stroke of luck,

09:34.720 --> 09:35.550
I had the honor of befriending him.

09:38.440 --> 09:39.000
How interesting.

09:40.600 --> 09:41.120
You...

09:42.200 --> 09:43.270
really are an interesting man.

09:47.600 --> 09:51.390
You're a close ally of Princess Danyang,

09:52.270 --> 09:53.790
and a regular visitor
to Chancellor Liu's.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.480
And now,

09:56.080 --> 09:57.630
you've befriended my son.

09:58.840 --> 09:59.600
Everyone says

10:00.200 --> 10:02.030
it's hard to get by in Sheng'an.

10:02.870 --> 10:05.440
Yet you seem to manage just fine.

10:08.200 --> 10:09.000
You flatter me, Lord Yu.

10:09.840 --> 10:10.870
I'm just a commoner.

10:11.630 --> 10:12.360
Without your help,

10:12.720 --> 10:14.360
I'd never have secured this post.

10:15.200 --> 10:17.390
I'd have been lost in Sheng'an,

10:18.270 --> 10:19.480
wasting my days away.

10:21.840 --> 10:24.390
Recommending talent to the court

10:25.030 --> 10:27.440
is simply a subject's duty.

10:28.000 --> 10:28.720
It's nothing.

10:32.240 --> 10:33.120
Speaking of which,

10:33.270 --> 10:36.690
the imperial exams seek talent
from across the realm,

10:36.740 --> 10:39.380
so the worthy can serve the court.

10:41.750 --> 10:42.600
Tell me,

10:43.480 --> 10:45.030
are you a man of talent

10:48.510 --> 10:49.790
or a man of greatness?

10:54.750 --> 10:55.870
Thanks to your support,

10:56.670 --> 10:57.240
I

10:58.120 --> 10:59.550
might just qualify

10:59.960 --> 11:00.840
as a third-rate talent.

11:04.480 --> 11:06.080
You're quite the straight shooter.

11:08.320 --> 11:09.150
But hold on.

11:10.150 --> 11:13.510
Aren't you scholars always so lofty,

11:14.150 --> 11:17.150
refusing to mix
with court insiders like me?

11:19.630 --> 11:22.320
A gentleman is indeed dignified.

11:23.510 --> 11:24.670
But for the people's sake,

11:25.150 --> 11:26.480
in times of peace,

11:27.480 --> 11:28.390
I'll follow the virtuous.

11:29.120 --> 11:30.750
As for who's on the throne,

11:31.840 --> 11:33.030
that hardly matters.

11:43.480 --> 11:43.840
Good!

11:45.150 --> 11:45.960
You've studied well,

11:46.320 --> 11:48.150
and not just from books.

11:49.080 --> 11:50.360
You're nothing like

11:51.120 --> 11:52.750
those stuffy, pedantic scholars.

11:55.600 --> 11:56.630
To be honest,

11:58.150 --> 11:59.000
my son

11:59.360 --> 12:00.840
has no learning to speak of.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.240
This silly boy

12:06.480 --> 12:09.390
has relied on my name
to get by at the Investigation Office.

12:10.150 --> 12:11.360
But after all these years,

12:11.790 --> 12:13.840
all he's learned are dirty tricks.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.000
From now on,

12:17.000 --> 12:18.200
I hope Scholar Yan

12:18.670 --> 12:19.550
will guide him more.

12:21.320 --> 12:21.960
I wouldn't presume.

12:22.510 --> 12:23.120
At least

12:23.750 --> 12:24.910
teach him some ways

12:25.550 --> 12:28.120
to get things done in the open.

12:30.440 --> 12:32.030
Please look after me, Mr. Yan.

12:33.480 --> 12:34.080
I wouldn't presume.

12:36.320 --> 12:36.750
All right.

12:38.270 --> 12:39.320
I know what you're thinking now.

12:40.270 --> 12:40.720
You two should

12:41.550 --> 12:42.030
spend more time together.

12:43.200 --> 12:43.630
Take care, Father.

12:57.080 --> 12:59.000
You really are an interesting man.

13:07.150 --> 13:08.320
Sorry to trouble you, sir.

13:09.120 --> 13:11.120
A few steps are no trouble at all.

13:12.910 --> 13:14.390
Tomorrow, I'll be turned away again.

13:14.750 --> 13:15.790
That's the real headache.

13:17.000 --> 13:19.600
Are you going to visit Chancellor Liu

13:20.390 --> 13:20.790
again tomorrow?

13:21.720 --> 13:23.030
That's no visit.

13:23.150 --> 13:24.150
You don't even get to see him.

13:26.550 --> 13:27.630
You have my sympathy, sir.

13:28.270 --> 13:29.390
Lord Yu must've ordered you to go.

13:30.440 --> 13:32.840
That old man doesn't even
attend court anymore.

13:33.030 --> 13:34.150
How much longer can he last?

13:34.670 --> 13:35.690
My father keeps making me

13:35.740 --> 13:37.570
put on this show
of respect for my mentors.

13:38.270 --> 13:39.270
Isn't that just fake?

13:43.670 --> 13:44.390
Do you know why

13:44.870 --> 13:46.840
Chancellor Liu keeps turning you away,

13:47.550 --> 13:48.790
yet your father keeps sending you back?

13:50.270 --> 13:50.840
Why?

13:51.910 --> 13:52.630
Because Chancellor Liu

13:53.120 --> 13:54.270
has never received you.

13:54.790 --> 13:55.360
So what?

13:55.600 --> 13:57.080
Spit it out.

13:59.870 --> 14:00.200
Come here.

14:04.030 --> 14:05.840
Chancellor Liu is the leading scholar
of our time,

14:06.150 --> 14:08.120
a role model to scholars everywhere.

14:08.480 --> 14:09.480
Lord Yu respects him,

14:09.910 --> 14:11.870
so he wants you to pay your respects.

14:12.390 --> 14:14.080
It shows your father values
mentors and learning.

14:14.720 --> 14:15.670
It's all a show,

14:16.360 --> 14:17.120
a public gesture,

14:17.840 --> 14:19.870
a way to reassure scholars

14:20.080 --> 14:21.550
across the realm.

14:22.840 --> 14:23.670
That makes sense.

14:24.670 --> 14:25.150
It does.

14:26.600 --> 14:27.720
But if Chancellor Liu won't see you,

14:28.120 --> 14:29.390
the show can't go on.

14:29.670 --> 14:31.120
This "valuing mentors and learning"

14:31.390 --> 14:32.360
can't be claimed.

14:32.630 --> 14:35.080
So you'll keep getting turned away.

14:37.000 --> 14:38.720
So if he sees me once,

14:39.790 --> 14:41.440
I won't have to keep going back,

14:41.630 --> 14:42.240
just to get snubbed?

14:43.960 --> 14:44.960
But my father warned me

14:45.550 --> 14:46.550
not to offend that old man.

14:46.750 --> 14:48.870
So I can't exactly drag him out, can I?

14:50.480 --> 14:52.840
Do you know why he won't see you?

14:53.670 --> 14:54.550
He can't stand me.

14:55.360 --> 14:56.510
Not quite.

14:57.510 --> 14:59.030
Everyone knows

15:00.000 --> 15:00.840
how things stand at court.

15:02.150 --> 15:03.150
Chancellor Liu is far too shrewd

15:03.550 --> 15:04.440
not to see what's going on.

15:04.840 --> 15:05.360
It's just that,

15:05.670 --> 15:06.910
as the leader of the scholars,

15:07.320 --> 15:07.670
he can't

15:08.600 --> 15:09.390
just

15:10.000 --> 15:10.440
meet you.

15:13.240 --> 15:13.910
Why not?

15:16.200 --> 15:16.670
Do you

15:17.480 --> 15:18.910
really want to meet him?

15:19.630 --> 15:20.120
I do.

15:20.720 --> 15:21.750
I swear on my life.

15:22.360 --> 15:24.030
If I see him just once,

15:24.390 --> 15:26.630
I'll have fulfilled my father's orders,

15:27.000 --> 15:28.200
and I'll be free.

15:31.200 --> 15:32.240
Why do you ask?

15:32.630 --> 15:33.910
Got a plan?

15:36.720 --> 15:37.550
I do,

15:38.390 --> 15:39.000
but...

15:39.720 --> 15:41.440
I can't guarantee it'll work.

15:41.670 --> 15:43.480
It's worth a try.

15:44.320 --> 15:44.910
Go on.

15:49.480 --> 15:50.480
For this to work,

15:51.320 --> 15:51.910
we need

15:52.320 --> 15:53.000
the right timing,

15:53.600 --> 15:53.960
the right place,

15:54.550 --> 15:55.120
and the right people.

15:57.200 --> 15:57.960
First, the right people.

15:58.630 --> 16:00.150
You always dress in luxury,

16:00.360 --> 16:01.760
riding a jeweled saddle,

16:01.810 --> 16:02.500
surrounded by servants.

16:02.910 --> 16:03.360
But Chancellor Liu

16:03.790 --> 16:05.910
keeps his distance
from the rich and powerful.

16:06.510 --> 16:07.870
He prefers to help the poor.

16:08.270 --> 16:09.270
Showing up dressed like that,

16:10.200 --> 16:11.510
you're barking up the wrong tree.

16:14.320 --> 16:15.270
Then I'll change.

16:16.080 --> 16:16.480
Exactly.

16:17.200 --> 16:19.120
Put away the silk for now

16:19.550 --> 16:20.790
and change into plain hemp robes.

16:22.030 --> 16:22.750
Have you seen

16:23.000 --> 16:24.670
how Imperial Academy students dress?

16:25.150 --> 16:26.910
The more you look like one, the better.

16:27.870 --> 16:29.480
That's how those elder scholars

16:29.670 --> 16:31.000
like to see people dressed.

16:32.720 --> 16:33.030
Got it.

16:35.320 --> 16:35.960
Now, the right place.

16:37.360 --> 16:38.720
However powerful your family is,

16:39.030 --> 16:40.120
once you're at his gate,

16:40.720 --> 16:41.670
you're on his turf.

16:42.120 --> 16:43.390
Whether he sees you

16:43.720 --> 16:44.910
is entirely up to him.

16:49.720 --> 16:50.480
I know.

16:51.910 --> 16:53.840
I can't keep going to his house
just to be snubbed.

16:54.320 --> 16:55.390
I'll have to catch him outside!

16:55.790 --> 16:56.600
Exactly.

16:57.240 --> 16:59.200
You're a genius!

16:59.600 --> 17:00.120
And the right timing?

17:00.440 --> 17:01.000
Tell me!

17:02.600 --> 17:03.910
The right timing...

17:06.200 --> 17:07.680
Well, if I tell you,

17:08.200 --> 17:09.270
you must keep it to yourself.

17:09.640 --> 17:11.440
Don't tell anyone you heard it from me.

17:12.160 --> 17:12.880
Don't worry.

17:13.310 --> 17:15.790
I'd never betray a friend!

17:20.830 --> 17:22.480
Today, my colleagues said

17:23.160 --> 17:24.030
Chancellor Liu plans

17:24.510 --> 17:27.590
to relax at Huanghua Stream
tomorrow morning.

17:28.070 --> 17:29.790
They're debating
whether to visit him there.

17:31.070 --> 17:32.640
Huanghua Stream...

17:35.720 --> 17:37.240
No gates to keep me out,

17:39.160 --> 17:40.310
no walls around the outskirts.

17:41.680 --> 17:42.720
He can't turn me away there!

17:46.350 --> 17:46.880
Tomorrow

17:47.270 --> 17:48.270
is the right time.

17:48.640 --> 17:50.070
Huanghua Stream is the right place.

17:50.400 --> 17:52.000
Mr. Yu, change your clothes,

17:52.270 --> 17:53.070
leave your attendants behind,

17:53.440 --> 17:54.920
and dress
like a scholar out for a stroll.

17:55.440 --> 17:56.070
Once you're close

17:56.440 --> 17:57.110
and Chancellor Liu spots you,

17:57.640 --> 17:58.750
it'll be too late to avoid you.

17:59.880 --> 18:00.480
That way,

18:01.160 --> 18:02.550
you'll have done
your duty to your father,

18:03.160 --> 18:04.240
and you can finally relax.

18:05.400 --> 18:07.160
If Chancellor Liu
doesn't go out tomorrow,

18:07.750 --> 18:09.400
you've only wasted one extra trip.

18:09.920 --> 18:10.350
Just think of it

18:10.790 --> 18:11.350
as a pleasant outing.

18:13.270 --> 18:13.920
Mr. Yan,

18:14.270 --> 18:15.880
you're like a real brother to me!

18:17.030 --> 18:18.270
Think nothing of it.

18:19.030 --> 18:21.750
But my plan's not very certain.

18:22.030 --> 18:22.590
If it doesn't work,

18:23.160 --> 18:24.070
don't hold it against me.

18:24.240 --> 18:25.070
Of course not!

18:25.400 --> 18:26.400
I'd thank you before anything else.

18:26.550 --> 18:26.830
Come on.

18:27.310 --> 18:28.440
My treat at Cuiyun Tower today!

18:28.830 --> 18:29.830
- You're too kind.
- Let's go!

18:33.310 --> 18:35.310
Let's find you
some plain hemp robes first.

18:35.480 --> 18:36.070
No rush.

18:37.400 --> 18:37.720
(Pingkang Ward Tavern)
(Hurry!)

18:38.030 --> 18:38.400
(Make way!)

18:38.680 --> 18:39.000
(Wangchun Wine)
(Make way!)

18:39.310 --> 18:39.640
(Make way!)

18:40.200 --> 18:40.760
- Make way!
- Hurry!

18:40.810 --> 18:41.330
(What's going on?)

18:41.380 --> 18:42.050
- Make way!
- What's all this?

18:42.100 --> 18:42.380
(Hurry!)

18:42.430 --> 18:43.030
(What's happening?)

18:43.350 --> 18:43.680
(Pingkang Ward)
Oh...

18:44.830 --> 18:45.200
Well...

18:48.720 --> 18:49.160
Sir.

18:49.720 --> 18:50.750
I was blind

18:50.920 --> 18:52.480
and failed to recognize
the honored guest.

18:53.070 --> 18:54.680
Her Highness Princess Danyang is here

18:55.350 --> 18:56.590
to sample your cooking.

19:02.110 --> 19:03.750
So it's Your Highness!

19:04.310 --> 19:05.110
Forgive me!

19:05.400 --> 19:06.110
Please, come right in!

19:08.310 --> 19:10.590
Why are there so many ruffians
in your tavern?

19:12.960 --> 19:13.720
Don't worry.

19:14.070 --> 19:15.400
They're all regulars.

19:15.680 --> 19:16.790
No riffraff here.

19:17.400 --> 19:18.790
How many heads can you bet on that?

19:19.680 --> 19:19.960
I...

19:20.400 --> 19:21.880
I only have one head to lose.

19:22.400 --> 19:23.030
Forgive me, Your Highness.

19:23.440 --> 19:24.640
I'll do whatever you say.

19:25.160 --> 19:26.070
Throw them all out.

19:26.750 --> 19:28.070
Her Highness will cover

19:28.720 --> 19:29.830
the cost of their food.

19:31.350 --> 19:32.640
You have
one incense stick's worth of time.

19:33.270 --> 19:34.480
Get them all out.

19:35.270 --> 19:35.920
Otherwise,

19:36.310 --> 19:37.480
I'll tear this shabby tavern down!

19:39.270 --> 19:39.830
Understood!

19:43.590 --> 19:44.210
Get out!

19:44.260 --> 19:44.900
Stop drinking! Move!

19:44.950 --> 19:45.820
I haven't finished eating!

19:46.110 --> 19:46.450
What's going on?

19:46.500 --> 19:47.220
This place is reserved today!

19:47.270 --> 19:47.810
Get out!

19:47.860 --> 19:48.750
This is outrageous!

19:55.110 --> 19:55.880
What did I tell you?

19:57.400 --> 19:58.720
Go ahead and report me.

19:59.110 --> 20:00.030
What good will that do?

20:00.720 --> 20:03.000
I'm still waiting
for the authorities to arrest me.

20:04.030 --> 20:05.920
Haven't seen a single one of them yet.

20:08.720 --> 20:09.830
Never mind crippling him,

20:10.240 --> 20:12.750
even if I killed him,
what could they do?

20:14.480 --> 20:14.750
Come on.

20:15.350 --> 20:15.750
Fill it up!

20:15.880 --> 20:17.400
(I told you,
the tavern's reserved today.)

20:17.640 --> 20:18.480
(Just go!)

20:19.200 --> 20:20.110
(Stop eating! Get out!)

20:21.160 --> 20:21.830
What's going on?

20:23.000 --> 20:23.830
Please calm down, sir.

20:24.160 --> 20:25.880
Princess Danyang suddenly showed up,

20:26.000 --> 20:27.680
saying our customers were a rough bunch

20:28.000 --> 20:28.880
and ordering us to clear the place.

20:29.590 --> 20:30.070
So, gentlemen...

20:33.590 --> 20:34.270
Sit down.

20:34.920 --> 20:35.960
What's all the fuss about?

20:36.720 --> 20:37.270
Listen,

20:37.590 --> 20:38.590
there's a reason

20:39.110 --> 20:40.550
you guys never get anywhere.

20:42.790 --> 20:43.400
Keep eating.

20:44.030 --> 20:46.070
I'll go greet the Princess.

20:47.960 --> 20:48.440
Zhang Jun,

20:49.110 --> 20:50.790
you know Princess Danyang?

20:50.920 --> 20:51.720
Not personally.

20:52.510 --> 20:53.960
And she doesn't know me either.

20:54.510 --> 20:54.880
But

20:55.400 --> 20:56.920
she must know my father.

20:57.310 --> 20:59.960
She can't just brush him off, can she?

21:13.750 --> 21:14.070
Hold it!

21:15.070 --> 21:15.510
Who are you?

21:17.510 --> 21:18.480
How many heads do you have to lose?

21:18.880 --> 21:19.830
How dare you speak to me like that?

21:20.070 --> 21:20.960
When you stopped me,

21:21.110 --> 21:22.400
did you ask your master inside first?

21:23.480 --> 21:24.270
Who's out there?

21:26.920 --> 21:27.310
Your Highness,

21:27.750 --> 21:28.440
I'm Zhang Jun.

21:29.200 --> 21:30.310
Zhang Jun? Who's that?

21:31.750 --> 21:33.350
My father is Zhang Cheng,
the Minister of Revenue...

21:47.200 --> 21:48.510
Ah, Mr. Zhang.

21:49.920 --> 21:51.270
Your name rang a bell,

21:51.550 --> 21:52.440
but I couldn't quite place it.

21:54.480 --> 21:55.160
Greetings, Your Highness.

21:56.510 --> 21:57.160
What do you want?

21:58.310 --> 21:59.200
Nothing much.

21:59.440 --> 22:02.030
I was drinking with friends next door

22:02.310 --> 22:03.680
when the owner was kicking us out.

22:04.000 --> 22:04.310
So,

22:04.680 --> 22:07.030
I'd shamelessly ask a favor
of Your Highness.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.110
What's there to ask?

22:10.070 --> 22:12.480
I'm only kicking out the riffraff.

22:12.960 --> 22:13.640
Surely

22:13.790 --> 22:15.790
I wouldn't kick out Mr. Zhang.

22:17.830 --> 22:18.510
Thank you, Your Highness.

22:19.510 --> 22:20.970
If there's nothing else,

22:21.020 --> 22:21.980
I'll take my leave.

22:22.070 --> 22:22.550
I'll be going.

22:23.310 --> 22:23.750
Wait.

22:24.750 --> 22:25.550
Drinking alone is no fun.

22:26.110 --> 22:28.160
Why not stay, Mr. Zhang?

22:28.880 --> 22:29.720
Join me here.

22:30.200 --> 22:31.070
We'll have a drink together.

22:31.640 --> 22:32.110
What do you say?

22:32.680 --> 22:33.070
Your Highness...

22:33.550 --> 22:33.830
Well...

22:34.680 --> 22:34.920
I...

22:36.160 --> 22:38.030
You're too kind!

22:40.160 --> 22:40.680
Fang Tong,

22:41.480 --> 22:43.750
lay an extra place for Mr. Zhang.

22:43.960 --> 22:44.270
Got it.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.440
Your Highness, one moment.

22:48.030 --> 22:49.440
Hey, you!

22:50.440 --> 22:52.000
Tell them

22:52.440 --> 22:52.960
that I

22:53.440 --> 22:54.350
and Her Highness

22:54.750 --> 22:55.880
hit it off the moment we met.

22:56.550 --> 22:57.640
So I won't join them.

22:58.160 --> 22:58.830
Let them

22:59.240 --> 23:00.400
put it on my tab.

23:00.590 --> 23:01.110
Got it?

23:02.510 --> 23:02.790
Yes, sir.

23:03.720 --> 23:04.000
Go on.

23:18.440 --> 23:19.170
Beautifully written!

23:19.220 --> 23:19.900
Exactly!

23:25.550 --> 23:26.440
(Move! Move!)

23:36.350 --> 23:36.750
That one.

23:37.240 --> 23:37.750
Grab him!

23:39.960 --> 23:40.440
What are you doing?

23:41.590 --> 23:41.850
Don't move!

23:41.900 --> 23:42.500
Who are you people?

23:42.790 --> 23:43.830
This is the Imperial Academy!

23:44.200 --> 23:44.450
Don't move!

23:44.500 --> 23:45.050
Let go of me!

23:48.000 --> 23:48.510
What are you doing?

23:54.200 --> 23:55.070
Looks about right.

23:55.240 --> 23:55.960
What do you mean?

23:56.270 --> 23:56.680
Take his clothes off.

23:57.000 --> 23:57.680
Got it!

23:58.270 --> 23:59.270
Strip him down!

23:59.790 --> 24:01.240
His robe, trousers,

24:01.550 --> 24:02.110
and shoes.

24:02.480 --> 24:03.410
Everything!

24:03.460 --> 24:04.220
Let me go!

24:04.720 --> 24:05.070
Let go!

24:06.720 --> 24:07.130
How is it?

24:07.180 --> 24:07.770
(Why's he stripping that man?)

24:07.820 --> 24:08.620
Do I have the air?

24:08.670 --> 24:09.140
(Who knows?)

24:10.110 --> 24:12.590
(Gathering Auspice)
Now that's an impressive presence!

24:13.440 --> 24:14.480
Am I not always impressive?

24:15.750 --> 24:16.680
Oh, look at me.

24:17.030 --> 24:19.160
Of course you are!

24:19.880 --> 24:20.550
You mean to ask

24:21.480 --> 24:22.270
what kind of air?

24:23.000 --> 24:23.680
Well,

24:24.510 --> 24:25.480
the scholarly sort,

24:25.640 --> 24:27.640
like those poor students.

24:27.920 --> 24:28.210
Do I have it?

24:28.260 --> 24:28.700
How could you say that?

24:28.750 --> 24:29.710
Who are you talking about?

24:31.480 --> 24:32.850
You do!

24:32.900 --> 24:34.050
(Gathering Auspice)
Absolutely!

24:35.550 --> 24:36.210
Definitely!

24:36.260 --> 24:36.610
Yes!

24:37.200 --> 24:37.720
Careful, sir.

24:38.070 --> 24:38.550
Careful.

24:41.750 --> 24:43.270
What a show-off.

24:43.510 --> 24:46.200
Stay away from that man. Remember that.

24:49.750 --> 24:50.070
Drink up!

24:51.480 --> 24:52.400
I never knew

24:52.880 --> 24:54.440
you could hold your liquor so well.

24:55.590 --> 24:56.960
I didn't know this before,

24:57.160 --> 24:58.910
but among Sheng'an's women,

24:58.960 --> 24:59.350
no one

24:59.720 --> 25:01.590
is bolder than Your Highness!

25:08.030 --> 25:09.070
I hardly ever

25:09.200 --> 25:10.790
leave the palace.

25:11.590 --> 25:12.960
So, have you heard

25:14.350 --> 25:15.680
any news in Sheng'an?

25:17.350 --> 25:17.750
Your Highness,

25:18.350 --> 25:20.030
now you're putting me on the spot.

25:20.400 --> 25:21.680
I usually stay home all day,

25:22.070 --> 25:24.130
studying or practicing martial arts,

25:24.180 --> 25:25.770
never setting foot outside.

25:26.000 --> 25:27.030
So I haven't heard anything.

25:30.110 --> 25:30.590
Fang Tong,

25:31.200 --> 25:32.440
have you heard anything?

25:33.110 --> 25:34.400
Tell us.

25:34.830 --> 25:35.200
Go on.

25:37.510 --> 25:38.070
Your Highness,

25:39.030 --> 25:39.790
lately,

25:40.440 --> 25:41.830
something unusual has happened.

25:42.160 --> 25:43.790
Word has it

25:44.830 --> 25:46.550
an auspicious sign has appeared

25:47.440 --> 25:48.200
at Huanghua Stream.

25:49.070 --> 25:49.920
What sign?

25:50.200 --> 25:53.030
Someone saw it recently:

25:53.510 --> 25:54.680
a white pheasant appears

25:55.110 --> 25:56.110
every morning

25:56.750 --> 25:57.830
by Huanghua Stream.

25:58.720 --> 25:59.270
That pheasant

25:59.790 --> 26:00.790
is pure white.

26:02.550 --> 26:03.790
What a wonderful omen!

26:06.640 --> 26:08.790
Wait... Huanghua Stream?

26:09.590 --> 26:10.750
I hunt there all the time!

26:11.960 --> 26:13.030
Where exactly along the stream?

26:14.960 --> 26:17.720
They say upstream,

26:18.680 --> 26:19.920
there's a thatched pavilion.

26:20.550 --> 26:21.400
The white pheasant

26:21.750 --> 26:24.200
often appears near it.

26:28.070 --> 26:29.240
What a pity.

26:30.830 --> 26:32.110
I'm just a weak woman,

26:32.960 --> 26:34.510
unable to hunt.

26:35.110 --> 26:37.680
The omen's at my door,
and I can't catch it.

26:39.750 --> 26:40.550
What a shame.

26:43.350 --> 26:44.200
Anything else?

26:45.480 --> 26:45.790
Yes.

26:46.960 --> 26:49.000
Cuiyun Tower

26:49.350 --> 26:51.000
has a new batch

26:51.640 --> 26:53.570
- of foreign dancing girls...
- (A white pheasant at Huanghua Stream.)

26:54.030 --> 26:55.350
(If I hunt it myself)

26:55.880 --> 26:56.880
(and take its tail feathers,)

26:57.200 --> 26:58.640
(then have Father present them
to Lord Yu...)

26:59.350 --> 27:00.680
They can even play the pipa?

27:01.590 --> 27:03.790
And sing and dance,

27:03.920 --> 27:04.310
too.

27:07.640 --> 27:08.880
Come on!

27:09.830 --> 27:11.000
Pour Mr. Zhang some wine.

27:12.160 --> 27:12.550
Thank you.

27:12.920 --> 27:14.680
Forgive my rudeness at the door earlier.

27:16.480 --> 27:16.920
Here, Your Highness.

27:24.180 --> 27:24.620
(Wangchun Wine)

27:32.640 --> 27:33.070
Fang Tong.

27:33.400 --> 27:34.240
What is it, Your Highness?

27:34.590 --> 27:35.590
Go find Yang Si.

27:36.550 --> 27:38.750
Ask if he'd like to join me tomorrow

27:39.400 --> 27:41.110
for an outing beyond the city.

27:41.510 --> 27:41.830
Understood.

28:11.260 --> 28:15.900
(Huanghua Stream)

28:18.070 --> 28:19.000
Sir, we're here.

28:34.750 --> 28:35.590
You can stay here.

28:36.480 --> 28:38.160
The old man hates
seeing you crowd around me.

28:38.550 --> 28:39.720
Looks like
we're throwing our weight around.

28:40.550 --> 28:41.640
Understood.

28:48.920 --> 28:50.110
Go see if I hit anything.

28:51.570 --> 28:52.330
Ah.

28:54.400 --> 28:54.880
Sir!

28:55.510 --> 28:56.350
It's a wild rabbit.

28:56.550 --> 28:56.920
It got away.

28:57.070 --> 28:57.590
A wild rabbit?

28:58.880 --> 29:01.070
Not worth wasting an arrow on!

29:01.510 --> 29:02.480
Come on, let's head up.

29:38.480 --> 29:39.070
Yan Shang.

29:39.590 --> 29:40.440
What are you looking at?

29:42.510 --> 29:43.480
The light is perfect.

29:43.830 --> 29:44.480
I'd say

29:45.200 --> 29:46.590
it's a fine day for hunting.

29:47.310 --> 29:48.110
You know how to hunt?

29:50.920 --> 29:51.270
No.

29:57.350 --> 29:57.880
(Huanghua Stream)
Your Highness.

29:58.480 --> 29:58.960
Got it.

29:59.510 --> 30:01.070
That brat's been firing arrows
the whole way.

30:05.310 --> 30:06.960
I'm running around
taking care of everything,

30:07.680 --> 30:09.720
while he sits comfortably
at Hongwen Hall,

30:11.000 --> 30:11.830
without a care in the world.

30:13.270 --> 30:14.000
Tell me about it.

30:21.110 --> 30:23.920
Yan Shang laid the bait perfectly.

30:24.640 --> 30:24.960
Let me do it.

30:30.750 --> 30:32.400
A son pays for his father's sins.

30:33.070 --> 30:35.640
Even killing you a hundred times
wouldn't be enough.

30:46.030 --> 30:47.270
My backside!

30:51.270 --> 30:52.970
Where'd that white pheasant go?

30:53.020 --> 30:54.740
White pheasant, where are you?

30:56.200 --> 30:56.480
Give one to me.

31:16.480 --> 31:17.000
Something's moving.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.110
Go check it out.

31:18.350 --> 31:18.640
Yes, sir.

31:26.550 --> 31:28.070
Sir, something's happened!

31:29.480 --> 31:30.090
Look at you!

31:31.590 --> 31:32.400
What happened?

31:32.960 --> 31:34.030
All that yelling and screaming.

31:34.550 --> 31:35.960
No wonder
you'll never amount to anything.

31:36.030 --> 31:37.400
Looks like... you hit someone.

31:43.400 --> 31:44.640
Wh-Why the panic?

31:46.030 --> 31:46.310
You,

31:47.790 --> 31:49.480
see if he's still breathing.

31:54.310 --> 31:55.400
Sir, he's not dead.

31:55.480 --> 31:56.400
H-he's still breathing.

32:00.720 --> 32:01.400
Then make sure he stops.

32:02.640 --> 32:04.240
Sir, he's still alive.

32:04.550 --> 32:06.960
(So young, yet so vicious.)

32:07.830 --> 32:09.830
(No wonder Her Highness told me
to keep an eye here.)

32:10.270 --> 32:10.750
What are you waiting for?

32:13.200 --> 32:14.070
If he wakes up, will you look after him?

32:15.750 --> 32:16.400
Listen,

32:17.110 --> 32:17.440
once...

32:18.750 --> 32:20.880
once he finds out I shot him,

32:21.110 --> 32:22.200
he'll report me to the authorities.

32:22.550 --> 32:23.000
And that'll

32:23.050 --> 32:24.420
get my father into serious trouble.

32:24.790 --> 32:25.030
Then I...

32:27.750 --> 32:28.160
Hurry up!

32:28.790 --> 32:29.400
Dig a hole and bury him.

32:30.200 --> 32:30.550
Yes, sir.

32:36.750 --> 32:38.350
Wanyao, have you been waiting long?

32:39.240 --> 32:39.880
No.

32:40.750 --> 32:41.680
I was just enjoying the scenery.

32:42.110 --> 32:42.720
It's so peaceful here.

32:42.920 --> 32:43.880
That mouth of yours,

32:44.030 --> 32:46.000
never a nice word since you were a kid.

32:46.590 --> 32:47.510
Good thing I'm used to it.

32:48.400 --> 32:48.720
Let's go.

32:49.400 --> 32:50.070
Let's wait for Fang Tong.

32:50.790 --> 32:51.680
He's checking the path ahead.

32:52.480 --> 32:53.070
He'll be back soon.

32:53.790 --> 32:54.510
He's coming back with us?

32:55.480 --> 32:56.510
Join us or head back.

32:57.110 --> 32:58.070
I'd like to join you.

33:00.510 --> 33:02.680
Last time we went out of town together,
we were kids.

33:03.400 --> 33:04.000
I remember

33:05.030 --> 33:05.790
you kept trying

33:05.920 --> 33:06.750
to shoot me in the backside.

33:10.030 --> 33:10.960
Enough chatter.

33:11.640 --> 33:12.720
Why don't you get back?

33:15.160 --> 33:15.550
Your Highness.

33:17.480 --> 33:17.920
Well?

33:18.680 --> 33:19.960
Found anywhere scenic?

33:20.070 --> 33:21.720
There's a reed marsh at Huanghua Stream.

33:22.030 --> 33:22.680
The scenery

33:24.110 --> 33:24.480
is lovely.

33:25.720 --> 33:26.240
Let's go.

33:38.790 --> 33:39.110
Wait.

33:40.830 --> 33:41.480
Someone's over there.

33:48.400 --> 33:49.130
Hurry up!

33:49.180 --> 33:49.810
Honestly!

33:49.860 --> 33:51.100
It took you forever to dig a hole.

33:51.310 --> 33:52.440
And now you can't even bury him quickly?

33:53.750 --> 33:54.920
Look at the time!

33:55.200 --> 33:57.160
Any later,
and my father will come looking for me.

33:58.350 --> 34:00.720
That's the son
of Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue.

34:00.770 --> 34:01.700
Hurry up and bury him!

34:01.750 --> 34:02.380
What's going on here?

34:02.430 --> 34:03.340
Even the horse is getting impatient.

34:06.880 --> 34:08.670
Come on, where's that energy you have
when you're eating?

34:12.550 --> 34:13.710
Is this murder?

34:14.960 --> 34:15.550
Let's go.

34:15.840 --> 34:16.510
We shouldn't get involved.

34:16.670 --> 34:17.000
No.

34:17.190 --> 34:18.840
Wanyao, have Fang Tong take you back.

34:19.110 --> 34:19.760
I have to save him.

34:20.070 --> 34:21.360
Be careful, then.
Don't do anything reckless.

34:22.550 --> 34:23.110
Don't worry.

34:24.550 --> 34:25.670
Whatever happens today,

34:25.880 --> 34:26.590
I'll take full responsibility.

34:26.960 --> 34:28.280
You won't be dragged into this.

34:29.400 --> 34:31.000
I'll pretend you were never here.

34:39.880 --> 34:40.440
Bury him!

34:40.760 --> 34:41.710
Put your backs into it!

34:41.960 --> 34:42.960
You can't even manage

34:43.070 --> 34:44.760
digging a hole and burying a man!

34:44.840 --> 34:46.230
I'm Assessor Yang Si
at the Court of Judicial Review!

34:46.670 --> 34:47.730
Who dares harm a life here?

34:47.780 --> 34:48.650
Go! Run!

34:49.710 --> 34:50.290
Go!

34:50.340 --> 34:50.730
Run!

34:53.230 --> 34:54.360
I thought they'd put up a fight.

34:54.440 --> 34:55.280
But they just ran.

34:57.590 --> 34:58.760
I should've let Wanyao stay.

34:59.550 --> 35:00.510
She would've loved the show.

35:26.140 --> 35:28.180
(Interrogation Chamber,
Court of Judicial Review)

35:38.670 --> 35:39.000
You...

35:39.800 --> 35:40.190
Who...

35:41.150 --> 35:41.710
Who are you?

35:43.110 --> 35:43.920
Where am I?

35:45.150 --> 35:46.150
This is the Court of Judicial Review.

35:47.280 --> 35:48.280
I'm Yang Si, an assessor here.

35:49.070 --> 35:50.230
You were hit by a stray arrow.

35:52.150 --> 35:52.510
It hurts...

35:53.150 --> 35:53.760
It hurts like hell!

35:54.630 --> 35:55.510
Who's the blind fool?

35:55.920 --> 35:57.230
I'll make them pay!

35:57.800 --> 35:58.070
Ow!

35:58.710 --> 35:59.440
What are you doing?

36:00.110 --> 36:01.480
Who's this quack?

36:02.280 --> 36:03.280
We don't have physicians here.

36:04.550 --> 36:05.190
He's the coroner.

36:05.360 --> 36:05.710
What?

36:06.510 --> 36:07.480
Your backside won't stop bleeding.

36:07.800 --> 36:08.360
Put some medicine on it.

36:15.190 --> 36:17.320
(General of Tiger Might is here!)

36:17.880 --> 36:18.590
General of Tiger Might.

36:21.150 --> 36:21.880
This is the Court of Judicial Review.

36:42.190 --> 36:43.800
(Lord Yu is here!)

36:56.280 --> 36:57.840
I'm Yang Si, an assessor
at the Court of Judicial Review.

37:06.360 --> 37:07.230
No serious harm.

37:08.920 --> 37:09.710
Thank you, Imperial Physician Gao.

37:10.000 --> 37:10.920
I'll take my leave.

37:11.440 --> 37:12.110
I'll bid you farewell here.

37:21.400 --> 37:23.150
You said just now you were...

37:25.360 --> 37:27.760
I'm Yang Si, an assessor
at the Court of Judicial Review.

37:29.280 --> 37:29.710
Go on.

37:32.840 --> 37:33.480
Rest assured, Lord Yu.

37:34.000 --> 37:34.880
This case is straightforward.

37:36.760 --> 37:37.670
As you can see,

37:38.670 --> 37:40.150
there's dirt in his ears and nose.

37:41.000 --> 37:42.190
When I found your son,

37:42.880 --> 37:44.320
some people
were trying to bury him alive.

37:44.590 --> 37:45.070
Where are they?

37:48.280 --> 37:48.880
I failed you.

37:49.840 --> 37:50.710
I couldn't capture them alive.

37:52.280 --> 37:52.670
However,

37:53.280 --> 37:54.800
I've removed the arrow left in your son

37:55.320 --> 37:56.110
by the culprit.

37:56.440 --> 37:57.000
It's evidence.

37:57.590 --> 37:57.960
Here, my lord.

38:02.800 --> 38:03.630
From what I can tell,

38:04.360 --> 38:05.440
someone was out hunting,

38:05.960 --> 38:07.000
and his arrow struck your son.

38:08.480 --> 38:09.510
It was more likely an accident

38:09.590 --> 38:10.670
than a deliberate attack.

38:11.800 --> 38:13.480
Whether it was an accident or not,

38:13.840 --> 38:15.000
we haven't reached a verdict yet.

38:19.030 --> 38:19.590
Go on.

38:23.190 --> 38:24.230
He's a madman.

38:24.920 --> 38:26.550
He was burying your son alive,

38:28.150 --> 38:29.590
trying to cover his tracks.

38:31.590 --> 38:32.550
You said

38:34.070 --> 38:36.150
someone saw that culprit

38:38.800 --> 38:40.190
trying to bury Xianyao alive.

38:41.150 --> 38:41.800
Did the witness

38:42.360 --> 38:44.320
get a good look at his face?

38:46.550 --> 38:47.150
I did.

38:49.630 --> 38:50.280
I saw him.

38:50.670 --> 38:52.550
It was Zhang Jun,
son of Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue.

38:53.400 --> 38:54.070
I've sent men to arrest him.

38:56.070 --> 38:56.840
I'll leave it to you, General Qiu.

38:58.030 --> 38:58.320
Understood.

39:03.400 --> 39:03.920
This matter

39:04.440 --> 39:05.760
is no longer your concern.

39:26.150 --> 39:26.630
Thank you.

39:27.280 --> 39:27.800
Thank you.

39:30.500 --> 39:34.180
(Zhang Cheng, Minister of Revenue)

39:34.230 --> 39:36.360
(Yintaimen Investigation Office)
Is my son here?

39:51.030 --> 39:51.590
Lord Yu.

39:52.840 --> 39:53.630
My lord above,

39:54.150 --> 39:55.550
I failed to discipline my son.

39:56.000 --> 39:57.190
I deserve to die for it.

39:58.000 --> 39:59.070
When that brat comes out,

39:59.590 --> 40:01.190
I'll break his legs!

40:06.150 --> 40:06.590
There's no need.

40:07.230 --> 40:07.550
No.

40:08.030 --> 40:08.480
There is.

40:08.760 --> 40:09.360
There is.

40:10.440 --> 40:11.030
Minister Zhang...

40:14.440 --> 40:15.230
Yintaimen

40:16.880 --> 40:18.710
has confirmed

40:19.030 --> 40:20.030
that your son

40:21.960 --> 40:24.400
accidentally shot Yu Xianyao

40:26.150 --> 40:27.710
while hunting.

40:29.000 --> 40:29.880
No intent to harm him.

40:33.110 --> 40:33.760
However,

40:35.510 --> 40:39.110
after finding the injured Yu Xianyao,

40:39.880 --> 40:41.670
he didn't get him help,

40:43.150 --> 40:45.400
but tried to bury him alive

40:46.320 --> 40:47.630
to cover his tracks.

40:48.230 --> 40:49.640
Under the law, he should...

40:49.690 --> 40:50.730
Lord Yu!

40:51.800 --> 40:53.480
My son is young and foolish.

40:53.590 --> 40:54.550
He acted recklessly

40:54.880 --> 40:56.360
and caused this terrible mess.

40:57.440 --> 40:58.190
Lord Yu,

40:58.670 --> 41:00.840
please be merciful and spare him.

41:01.510 --> 41:03.280
I have some modest wealth.

41:03.480 --> 41:04.880
I'm willing to give it all up.

41:05.320 --> 41:07.110
Please show mercy!

41:24.760 --> 41:25.440
Minister Zhang,

41:26.280 --> 41:26.960
please get up.

41:29.440 --> 41:29.960
Lord Yu...

41:30.280 --> 41:30.760
Minister Zhang.

41:32.760 --> 41:34.150
Minister Zhang!

41:37.590 --> 41:38.880
I'm a eunuch.

41:41.190 --> 41:42.710
I'm a eunuch!

41:45.070 --> 41:46.400
I have no children of my own.

41:47.960 --> 41:50.760
For over ten years,
through every hardship,

41:51.630 --> 41:54.670
I raised my adopted son to adulthood.

41:56.320 --> 41:57.320
Even I,

41:58.400 --> 42:02.280
the "treacherous eunuch"
you all call me,

42:03.630 --> 42:05.110
know a child must be taught

42:05.920 --> 42:07.360
to obey the law and the rites,

42:08.150 --> 42:09.760
to cultivate virtue!

42:11.000 --> 42:12.440
Don't you?

42:13.110 --> 42:13.440
I...

42:14.190 --> 42:15.590
You old scumbag!

42:15.920 --> 42:17.360
You vile beast!

42:17.880 --> 42:18.150
You...

42:20.110 --> 42:21.630
You're a bandit!

42:26.960 --> 42:27.800
Lord Yu...

42:29.590 --> 42:30.000
Lord Yu...

42:33.880 --> 42:34.280
Lord Yu...

42:35.440 --> 42:36.110
Lord Yu!

42:36.880 --> 42:38.230
My son is ignorant

42:38.550 --> 42:40.150
and has offended your son.

42:40.550 --> 42:42.760
He deserves to die.

42:43.710 --> 42:46.330
But I'm nearly seventy,

42:46.380 --> 42:48.170
and he's my only son.

42:48.840 --> 42:50.760
If anything happens to him,

42:51.280 --> 42:54.230
I won't be able to go on either.

42:55.800 --> 42:56.320
Lord Yu!

42:57.150 --> 42:57.710
Please,

42:58.150 --> 43:00.280
let me take the blame for my son.

43:00.550 --> 43:02.000
Please spare his life!

43:03.030 --> 43:03.630
Lord Yu!

43:04.230 --> 43:05.880
I beg you, Lord Yu!

43:06.110 --> 43:09.440
Lord Yu, have mercy!

43:11.320 --> 43:11.800
Lord Yu!

43:13.320 --> 43:14.800
Spare his life!

43:16.760 --> 43:17.360
Minister Zhang,

43:19.230 --> 43:20.510
you're being foolish.

43:22.630 --> 43:24.480
How dare anyone interfere

43:25.000 --> 43:26.400
with Yintaimen's punishment?

43:28.030 --> 43:28.590
Lord Yu!

43:29.070 --> 43:29.800
Lord Yu!

43:30.630 --> 43:31.150
Lord Yu!

43:32.550 --> 43:34.030
Please show mercy!

43:34.440 --> 43:35.840
Spare his life!

43:36.590 --> 43:37.510
Lord Yu!

43:38.030 --> 43:41.280
Lord Yu, please have mercy!

43:50.150 --> 43:52.110
Tonight, prepare me
some roast camel hump.

43:53.110 --> 43:54.030
Make it

43:54.590 --> 43:55.400
a little crispy.

43:56.070 --> 43:58.150
And prepare some chicken rump.

43:58.760 --> 43:59.480
Make sure

43:59.670 --> 44:00.400
it's nice and fatty.

44:01.110 --> 44:02.070
I need to restore my health.

44:02.710 --> 44:03.190
Understood?

44:03.400 --> 44:04.110
- Got it.
- Got it.

44:08.970 --> 44:10.730
Ow!

44:10.780 --> 44:15.130
My backside hurts!

44:15.180 --> 44:16.350
How is he today?

44:16.510 --> 44:17.110
- It hurts...
- My lord.

44:17.400 --> 44:18.880
The imperial physician said he's fine.

44:27.630 --> 44:30.070
My backside...

44:30.320 --> 44:33.110
It hurts so much...

44:33.800 --> 44:35.840
My backside...

44:37.880 --> 44:38.440
Enough.

44:39.150 --> 44:40.030
Does it really hurt that much?

44:40.630 --> 44:41.190
Father!

44:41.800 --> 44:42.880
It hurts so much!

44:43.150 --> 44:44.590
I nearly got shot dead!

44:44.960 --> 44:45.710
Of course it hurts!

44:45.840 --> 44:47.000
I was scared out of my wits!

44:48.840 --> 44:50.190
Now you know what pain feels like.

44:50.880 --> 44:51.800
What have I always taught you?

44:52.360 --> 44:53.880
A man of wealth
shouldn't put himself at risk.

44:54.360 --> 44:56.000
Why wander into such remote places?

44:56.760 --> 44:57.840
Look, Father.

44:58.550 --> 45:00.360
You told me to get closer
to Chancellor Liu.

45:00.440 --> 45:02.400
I heard he was going to rest
at Huanghua Stream.

45:02.710 --> 45:03.880
So I went there specially,

45:04.590 --> 45:06.510
hoping to run into him.

45:07.400 --> 45:09.590
I even dressed like a proper scholar

45:10.360 --> 45:11.360
and bought him a gift.

45:11.710 --> 45:12.670
It doesn't hurt anymore?

45:14.070 --> 45:15.960
How can you say that? It hurts!

45:16.590 --> 45:17.570
- It hurts so much...
- Enough.

45:18.840 --> 45:19.400
Drop the act.

45:20.590 --> 45:22.150
When have you ever planned things

45:22.400 --> 45:23.550
so carefully before?

45:24.070 --> 45:25.030
Did someone put you up to this?

45:31.300 --> 45:35.900
(Next Episode Preview)

45:36.150 --> 45:37.960
I have one more favor to ask.

45:38.840 --> 45:40.510
I beg you to send me to the palace

45:40.920 --> 45:42.190
to serve as a palace eunuch.

45:44.630 --> 45:45.670
Well said, Liu Wenji.

45:46.360 --> 45:47.280
I didn't want to help you,

45:47.880 --> 45:49.960
but I've changed my mind.

45:52.280 --> 45:55.573
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

45:58.258 --> 46:03.174
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

46:05.368 --> 46:11.213
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

46:11.713 --> 46:16.939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

46:19.708 --> 46:24.499
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

46:25.335 --> 46:31.414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

46:33.215 --> 46:36.365
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

46:36.365 --> 46:38.013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

46:38.065 --> 46:41.789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

46:42.167 --> 46:46.833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

46:47.452 --> 46:51.493
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

46:51.984 --> 46:54.099
♪Not a single hour less♪

46:54.139 --> 47:01.085
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

47:01.848 --> 47:05.301
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

47:05.481 --> 47:08.626
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

47:09.065 --> 47:15.702
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

47:16.099 --> 47:18.137
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:18.137 --> 47:20.613
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:20.651 --> 47:23.120
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:23.324 --> 47:30.211
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

47:30.523 --> 47:33.794
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

47:34.099 --> 47:37.272
♪My last untouched innocence♪

47:37.596 --> 47:41.022
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

47:41.255 --> 47:44.480
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

47:44.811 --> 47:51.607
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

47:51.976 --> 47:54.038
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

47:54.039 --> 47:56.542
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

47:56.589 --> 47:58.927
♪You're the only one I need♪

47:59.158 --> 48:05.993
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

48:06.342 --> 48:07.960
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

48:08.090 --> 48:09.886
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

48:10.243 --> 48:13.260
♪You're the only one I need♪

48:13.300 --> 48:14.627
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
